OL,3,AOlympian Ciara Mageean was a 'talented
OL,4,Aand inspirational human being'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOlympian Ciara Mageean has been
OL,7,Fdescribed as a "truly remarkable,
OL,8,Fimmensely talented and inspirational
OL,9,Fhuman being" in a tribute read out at
OL,10,Fher funeral.
OL,12,FHundreds of people have paid their
OL,13,Frespects to the runner at her funeral
OL,14,Fon Tuesday.
OL,16,FThe former European champion and
OL,17,Ftwo-time Olympic runner died on Sunday
OL,18,Fafter she was diagnosed with stage four
OL,19,Fbowel cancer.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
