OL,3,AOlympian Ciara Mageean was a 'talented
OL,4,Aand inspirational human being'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmong those in attendance at the
OL,7,Ffuneral in Portaferry, County Down,
OL,8,Fwere Northern Ireland First Minister
OL,9,FMichelle O'Neill, as well as fellow
OL,10,FOlympian Rhys McClenaghan and 1972 gold
OL,11,Fmedallist Lady Mary Peters.
